# Multi-origin canonicalization (Cloudflare Pages _redirects)
# 1) Canonical www / apex: apex -> www (SEO-safe, 301)
yeatru.com/*                https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301

# 2) GitHub Pages + Cloudflare Pages preview domains -> production domain
yeatru.github.io/*          https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301
*.pages.dev/*               https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301

# 3) Trailing-slash consistency (optional; kept here for crawlers)
# (Not enforcing since Cloudflare auto-strips for HTML, this is defense-in-depth)

# 4) Legacy product files that once had broken SKUs — point 301 to the catalog
/product-YCS-DGO-013.html   /all-products.html                    301
/product-YCS-DGO-014.html   /all-products.html                    301
